+3.  **Compute Culling Metadata for New Bricks:** For each scalar value in new bricks, determine the corresponding leaf node [S1, unofficial]. If the value is outside the current min/max, update it using `atomicMin` or `atomicMax` to handle concurrent thread updates [S1, unofficial]. Mark the parent as a candidate [S1, unofficial].
